SUMMARY:Writing Critique Night
DESCRIPTION:Join fellow writers and a representative of the NC Writers’ Network for a night of productive critique! Bring 3 or fewer pages of prose or poetry to receive feedback in small groups\, then offer your own feedback to other writers in return. If possible\, please bring a printed copy of your work. Registration is requested.
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/writing-critique-night/
LOCATION:Oberlin Regional Library\, 1930 Clark Ave\, Raleigh\, 27605
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/eventcalendarimage.png
END:VEVENT
