UID:10007410-1778873400-1778878800@unitedarts.org
SUMMARY:"Suite Surrender" Spring Play
DESCRIPTION:It’s 1942\, and two of Hollywood’s biggest divas have descended\nupon the luxurious Palm Beach Royale Hotel — assistants\, luggage\,\nand legendary feud with one another in tow. Everything seems to\nbe in order for their wartime performance…that is\, until they are\nsomehow assigned to the same suite. Mistaken identities\, overblown\negos\, double entendres\, and a lap dog named Mr. Boodles round\nout this hilarious riot of a love note to the classic farces of the 30s\nand 40s. Tickets are available at the Halle Cultural Arts Center box\noffice\, TheHalle.org\, and etix.com. \nTickets: Adults-$18 / Senior-$15 / Youth (16 & under)-$12\nhttps://www.etix.com/ticket/p/66870412/suite-surrenderspring-play-may-15730pm-apex-halle-cultural-arts-center?gclid=
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/suite-surrender-spring-play-5/
LOCATION:The Halle Cultural Arts Center\, 237 N. Salem St.\, Apex\, NC\, 27332\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Suite-Surrender-Flyer-500-x-500-px-3.png
ORGANIZER;CN="The Halle Cultural Arts Center":MAILTO:halleculturalartscenter@apexnc.org
END:VEVENT
